    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are asleep.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">As you sleep, you disassociate from your body and peer into the shores of the Astral Plane. While in this state, you can observe an area within 60 feet of your body in the Material Plane even as you sleep, but you occasionally catch sight of the vague occurrences where the Astral Plane overlaps. If you a creature of the Astral Plane notices you and interacts with you in any way, you wake up. If you wake up, your disassociated self returns to your body as you regain consciousness.</span></p>"
